# NAS bridge environment example. Placeholders only. Do not put real tokens here.
# Copy the values you need into compose or the systemd unit, then replace them.

# Comma-separated HTTPS webhook hostnames. Required when the bridge is enabled.
# An empty value does not allow every host. Startup and send time both refuse it.
DBR_WAKE_ALLOWEDHOSTS=YOUR_WEBHOOK_HOST

# Optional HMAC rotation. Point this at the previous key file (mode 0600, root-owned).
# The previous key is accepted only while previousSince is inside the rotation window
# (state/envelope-rotation.json or ENVELOPE_ROTATION_SINCE).
# ENVELOPE_HMAC_KEY_PREVIOUS_FILE=/srv/ssd1/discord-bridge/secrets/envelope_hmac_previous
